==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|fr}} root *''salāre'', from a change in conjugation of {{term|salire|salīre|lang=la}}, present active infintive of {{term|salio|saliō|I salt|lang=la}} < {{term|sal|lang=la}}. Compare Italian {{term|salare|lang=it}}, Romanian ''[[săra]]'', Spanish, Portuguese, and Catalan ''[[salar]]''.

